#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:3
msgid "Using the Client"
msgstr "Ag Úsáid an Chliaint"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Nextcloud desktop client runs in the background. Open its settings from "
"the system tray on Windows and Linux or the menu bar on macOS."
msgstr ""
"Ritheann cliant deisce Nextcloud sa chúlra. Oscail a chuid socruithe ón "
"tráidire córais ar Windows agus Linux, nó ón mbarra roghchláir ar macOS."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:11
msgid "Add account"
msgstr "Cuir cuntas leis"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:13
msgid ""
"To connect another Nextcloud account, open the settings dialog and click "
"**Add account** in the sidebar. Enter the address you use to access your "
"Nextcloud server in a browser, then click **Log in**."
msgstr ""
"Chun cuntas Nextcloud eile a nascadh, oscail an dialóg socruithe agus "
"cliceáil ar **Cuir cuntas leis** sa bharra taoibh. Cuir isteach an seoladh a"
" úsáideann tú chun rochtain a fháil ar do fhfreastalaí Nextcloud i "
"mbrabhsálaí, agus ansin cliceáil ar **Logáil isteach**."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:16
msgid "Setup wizard with the server address field and Log in button"
msgstr ""
"Treoraí socraithe ina bhfuil réimse do sheoladh an fhreastalaí agus cnaipe "
"logála isteach"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:21
msgid ""
"If your network requires a proxy, click **Proxy settings** before logging "
"in. Choose the system proxy or enter your proxy settings manually, then "
"click **Done**."
msgstr ""
"Más gá seachfhreastalaí do do líonra, cliceáil **Socruithe "
"seachfhreastalaí** sula logálann tú isteach. Roghnaigh seachfhreastalaí an "
"chórais nó cuir isteach do shocruithe seachfhreastalaí de láimh, ansin "
"cliceáil **Críochnaithe**."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:24
msgid ""
"Proxy settings dialog with no proxy, system proxy, and manual proxy options"
msgstr ""
"Bosca dialóige socruithe seachfhreastalaí, ina bhfuil roghanna ann gan "
"seachfhreastalaí, seachfhreastalaí an chórais, agus seachfhreastalaí de "
"láimh"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:29
msgid ""
"If the secure connection fails, check the server address and contact your "
"server administrator. The wizard may offer to connect without TLS or use a "
"client certificate. Use **Use client certificate** only if your server "
"requires one."
msgstr ""
"Má theipeann ar an nasc slán, seiceáil seoladh an fhreastalaí agus déan "
"teagmháil le riarthóir an fhreastalaí. D’fhéadfadh an draoi a mholadh nasc a"
" bhunú gan TLS nó deimhniú cliant a úsáid. Ná roghnaigh **Úsáid deimhniú "
"cliant** ach amháin má éilíonn do fhreastalaí ceann."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:32
msgid ""
"Warning that the secure server connection failed, with client certificate "
"and unencrypted options"
msgstr ""
"Rabhadh gur theip ar an nasc freastalaí slán, i gcásanna a bhaineann le "
"teastas cliant agus roghanna gan chriptiú"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:37
msgid ""
"If prompted for a client certificate, choose the PKCS#12 file provided by "
"your administrator, enter its password, and click **Connect**."
msgstr ""
"Má iarrtar ort teastas cliant a sholáthar, roghnaigh an comhad PKCS#12 a "
"chuir do riarthóir ar fáil, cuir isteach an focal faire a bhaineann leis, "
"agus cliceáil **Ceangail**."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:40
msgid "Client certificate dialog with certificate file and password fields"
msgstr ""
"Bosca dialóige do theastas cliant, ina bhfuil réimsí le haghaidh comhad "
"teastais agus pasfhocal"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:45
msgid ""
"The wizard asks you to switch to your browser. Click **Open** if the browser"
" does not open automatically. Log in and grant the desktop client access "
"when prompted. Then return to the wizard."
msgstr ""
"Iarrann an draoi ort aistriú chuig do bhrabhsálaí. Cliceáil **Oscail** mura "
"n-osclaíonn an brabhsálaí go huathoibríoch. Logáil isteach agus tabhair "
"rochtain don chliant deisce nuair a iarrtar ort é sin a dhéanamh. Ansin, "
"fill ar an draoi."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:48
msgid "Setup wizard prompting you to open a browser to authorize the account"
msgstr ""
"Treoraí socraithe ag iarraidh ort brabhsálaí a oscailt chun an cuntas a "
"údarú"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:53
msgid ""
"Choose how to sync your files. With classic synchronization, choose "
"**Synchronize everything** or **Choose what to sync**. Use **Choose** beside"
" **Local sync folder** to change where files are stored, then click "
"**Done**."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an chaoi chun do chuid comhad a shioncronú. Sa tsioncronú "
"clasaiceach, roghnaigh **Sioncronaigh gach rud** nó **Roghnaigh cad ba "
"cheart a shioncronú**. Úsáid **Roghnaigh** in aice le **Fillteán "
"sioncronaithe áitiúil** chun an áit a stóráiltear comhaid a athrú, agus "
"ansin cliceáil **Déanta**."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:56
msgid ""
"Classic synchronization options and local sync folder in the setup wizard"
msgstr ""
"Roghanna sioncronaithe clasaiceacha agus fillteán sioncronaithe áitiúil san "
"draoi socraithe"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:61
msgid ""
"You can choose **File Provider** to download files on demand. Click **Done**"
" to finish adding the account. On macOS, see :doc:`macosfileprovider` for "
"details about Finder integration."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat **Soláthraí Comhad** (File Provider) a roghnú chun comhaid a "
"íoslódáil de réir mar a bhíonn gá leo. Cliceáil **Déanta** chun an cuntas a "
"chur leis. Ar macOS, féach :doc:`macosfileprovider` le haghaidh sonraí faoin"
" gcomhtháthú le Finder."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:64
msgid "File Provider selected in the setup wizard"
msgstr "Soláthraí Comhad roghnaithe san draoi socraithe"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:69
msgid ""
"Before finishing classic synchronization, click **Advanced** if you want "
"confirmation before syncing large folders or external storage. Set your "
"preferences in **Advanced options**, then click **Done** to return to the "
"wizard."
msgstr ""
"Sula gcríochnaíonn tú an sioncronú clasaiceach, cliceáil **Ardroghanna** más"
" mian leat deimhniú a fháil sula ndéantar fillteáin mhóra nó stóráil "
"sheachtrach a shioncronú. Socraigh do roghanna in **Ardroghanna**, ansin "
"cliceáil **Déanta** chun filleadh ar an draoi."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:72
msgid ""
"Advanced options for large folders and external storage in the setup wizard"
msgstr ""
"Roghanna ardleibhéil le haghaidh fillteán mór agus stórála seachtraí sa "
"draoi socraithe"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:78
msgid "Settings dialog"
msgstr "Dialóg socruithe"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:80
msgid ""
"Select an account in the sidebar to see its sync status, local folder, "
"storage usage, and connection settings. Use **Add Folder Sync Connection** "
"to set up another classic sync folder for that account. You can log out or "
"remove the account from the same page."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cuntas sa bharra taoibh chun stádas sioncronaithe, fillteán "
"áitiúil, úsáid stórála, agus socruithe ceangail an chuntais sin a fheiceáil."
" Úsáid **Cuir Ceangal Sioncronaithe Fillteáin leis** chun fillteán "
"sioncronaithe clasaiceach eile a shocrú don chuntas sin. Is féidir leat "
"logáil amach nó an cuntas a bhaint ón leathanach céanna."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:84
msgid ""
"Account settings with classic sync status, connection settings, and account "
"controls"
msgstr ""
"Socruithe cuntais le stádas sioncronaithe clasaiceach, socruithe ceangail, "
"agus rialuithe cuntais"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:89
msgid ""
"Under **General**, choose whether to launch the client at startup, use "
"monochrome icons, and show notifications. On macOS, you can also enable File"
" Provider for all accounts. This setting replaces classic sync folders and "
"their Finder integration."
msgstr ""
"Faoi **Ginearálta**, roghnaigh cé acu an seolfar an cliant ag am tosaithe, "
"an n-úsáidfear deilbhíní monacrómacha, agus an dtaispeánfar fógraí. Ar "
"macOS, is féidir leat 'Soláthraí Comhad' (File Provider) a chumasú do gach "
"cuntas freisin. Cuireann an socrú seo in áit na seanfhillteán sioncronaithe "
"agus an chomhtháthaithe atá acu le Finder."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:93
msgid "General settings for startup, icons, File Provider, and notifications"
msgstr ""
"Socruithe ginearálta don tosú, deilbhíní, Soláthraí Comhad, agus fógraí"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:98
msgid ""
"Under **Advanced**, set confirmation thresholds for large folders and "
"external storage. You can also adjust the server polling interval, decide "
"whether removed files go to the trash, edit ignored files, or create a debug"
" archive."
msgstr ""
"Faoi **Ardroghanna**, socraigh tairseacha deimhnithe le haghaidh fillteán "
"mór agus stóráil sheachtrach. Is féidir leat freisin an t-eatramh vótála "
"freastalaí a choigeartú, a chinneadh an rachaidh comhaid a scriostar chuig "
"an mbruscar, comhaid a ndéantar neamhaird díobh a chur in eagar, nó cartlann"
" dífhabhtaithe a chruthú."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:101
msgid ""
"Advanced settings for sync confirmations, server polling, ignored files, and"
" debug archives"
msgstr ""
"Socruithe ardleibhéil le haghaidh deimhnithe sioncronaithe, vótáil "
"freastalaí, comhaid a dhéantar neamhaird díobh, agus cartlanna dífhabhtaithe"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:108
msgid ""
"To exclude files or folders from synchronization, click **Edit Ignored "
"Files** under **Advanced**. Add a pattern for each item you want to ignore. "
"An asterisk (``*``) matches any number of characters, a question mark "
"(``?``) matches one character, and a trailing slash (``/``) limits a pattern"
" to folders. Select **Allow Deletion** only for ignored items that the "
"client may remove when they prevent a folder from being deleted. Click "
"**OK** to save."
msgstr ""
"Chun comhaid nó fillteáin a eisiamh ó shioncrónú, cliceáil **Cuir Comhaid "
"Neamhaird in Eagar** faoi **Ardleibhéil**. Cuir patrún leis do gach mír ar "
"mhaith leat neamhaird a dhéanamh orthu. Comhfhreagraíonn réalta (``*``) "
"d'aon líon carachtar, comhfhreagraíonn comhartha ceiste (``?``) d'aon "
"charachtar amháin, agus cuireann slais deiridh (``/``) teorainn le patrún do"
" fhillteáin. Roghnaigh **Ceadaigh Scriosadh** ach amháin le haghaidh "
"míreanna neamhairdithe a d'fhéadfadh an cliant a bhaint nuair a chuireann "
"siad cosc ​​ar fhillteán a scriosadh. Cliceáil **Ceart go leor** le sábháil."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:113
msgid ""
"Ignored files editor with patterns, Allow Deletion checkboxes, and save "
"controls"
msgstr ""
"Eagarthóir comhad neamhairdthe le patrúin, boscaí seiceála chun scriosadh a "
"cheadú, agus rialuithe sábhála"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:118
msgid ""
"Under **Info**, you can check the desktop client version and open its usage "
"documentation or legal notice."
msgstr ""
"Faoin rannán **Eolas**, is féidir leat leagan an chliaint deisce a sheiceáil"
" agus an doiciméadúchán úsáide nó an fógra dlíthiúil a oscailt."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:120
msgid "Info page showing the desktop client version and documentation link"
msgstr ""
"Leathanach eolais a thaispeánann leagan an chliaint deisce agus nasc chuig "
"doiciméadúchán"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:126
msgid "Systray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín an tráidire córais"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:128
msgid ""
"The desktop client shows a status icon in the system tray on Windows and "
"Linux or the menu bar on macOS. Colorful status icons and colorful or "
"monochrome tray icons are available for the same sync states. You can choose"
" monochrome icons under **General** in the settings dialog."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann an cliant deisce deilbhín stádais sa tráidire córais ar Windows "
"agus Linux, nó sa bharra roghchláir ar macOS. Tá deilbhíní stádais ildaite, "
"chomh maith le deilbhíní tráidire atá ildaite nó monacrómach, ar fáil do na "
"staideanna sioncronaithe céanna. Is féidir leat deilbhíní monacrómacha a "
"roghnú faoi **Ginearálta** sa dialóg socruithe."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:132
msgid "Synchronization status icons"
msgstr "Deilbhíní stádais sioncronaithe"

