#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:140
msgid "Color tray"
msgstr "Tráidire dathanna"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:141
msgid "Up to date and connected"
msgstr "Cothrom le dáta agus ceangailte"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:142
msgid "Colorful up-to-date status icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín stádais ildaite cothrom le dáta"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:146
msgid "Monochrome up-to-date tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín tráidire monacrómach nua-aimseartha"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:150
msgid "Colorful up-to-date tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín tráidire ildaite agus cothrom le dáta"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:154
msgid "Synchronizing"
msgstr "Ag sioncronú"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:155
msgid "Colorful synchronizing status icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín stádais ildaite a léiríonn sioncronú"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:159
msgid "Monochrome synchronizing tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín tráidire sioncronaithe monacrómach"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:163
msgid "Colorful synchronizing tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín tráidire ildaite a shioncronaíonn"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:167
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Curtha ar sos"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:168
msgid "Colorful paused status icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín stádais ildaite i staid sosaithe"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:172
msgid "Monochrome paused tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín tráidire monacrómach ar sos"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:176
msgid "Colorful paused tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín tráidire ildaite ar sos"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:180
msgid "Offline"
msgstr "As líne"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:181
msgid "Colorful offline status icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín stádais as líne ildaite"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:185
msgid "Monochrome offline tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín tráidire as líne, aon dath"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:189
msgid "Colorful offline tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín tráidire ildaite (as líne)"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:193
msgid "Warning; open the client for details"
msgstr "Rabhadh; oscail an cliant chun tuilleadh sonraí a fháil"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:194
msgid "Colorful warning status icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín stádais rabhaidh ildaite"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:198
msgid "Monochrome warning tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín rabhaidh monacrómach sa tráidire"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:202
msgid "Colorful warning tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín foláirimh ildaite sa tráidire"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:206
msgid "Error; open the client for details"
msgstr "Earráid; oscail an cliant chun sonraí a fháil"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:207
msgid "Colorful error status icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín stádais earráide ildaite"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:211
msgid "Monochrome error tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín earráide monacrómach sa tráidire"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:215
msgid "Colorful error tray icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín dathúil earráide sa tráidire"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:220
msgid ""
"Open the tray or menu bar icon to view the client and its available actions,"
" such as pausing or resuming sync."
msgstr ""
"Oscail an deilbhín sa tráidire nó sa bharra roghchláir chun an cliant agus "
"na gníomhartha atá ar fáil dó a fheiceáil, mar shampla an sioncronú a chur "
"ar sos nó a atosú."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:223
msgid "File manager overlay icons"
msgstr "Deilbhíní forleagtha i mbainisteoir comhad"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:225
msgid ""
"For classic sync folders, the desktop client adds overlay icons to files in "
"the file manager. A green checkmark means a file is up to date. A warning "
"icon can mean that a file is ignored; a red X indicates a sync error. A blue"
" icon indicates a file waiting to sync or currently syncing. When the client"
" is offline, it does not show overlays for the folder's current sync state."
msgstr ""
"I gcás fillteán sioncronaithe clasaiceacha, cuireann an cliant deisce "
"deilbhíní forleagtha le comhaid sa bhainisteoir comhad. Ciallaíonn tic glas "
"go bhfuil comhad cothrom le dáta. D’fhéadfadh sé a chiallaíonn deilbhín "
"rabhaidh go ndearnadh neamhaird de chomhad; léiríonn X dearg earráid "
"sioncronaithe. Léiríonn deilbhín gorm go bhfuil comhad ag fanacht le "
"sioncronú nó á shioncronú faoi láthair. Nuair nach bhfuil an cliant "
"ceangailte leis an líonra, ní thaispeánann sé deilbhíní forleagtha a "
"léiríonn staid reatha sioncronaithe an fhillteáin."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:230
msgid ""
"A folder's overlay reflects sync errors in its contents. Ignored files do "
"not change the parent folder's status. On macOS, File Provider uses the "
"standard Finder status indicators described in :doc:`macosfileprovider`."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn forleagan fillteáin earráidí sioncronaithe a bhaineann lena bhfuil "
"ann. Ní athraíonn comhaid a ndearnadh neamhaird díobh stádas an fhillteáin "
"ina bhfuil siad. Ar macOS, úsáideann File Provider na táscairí stádais "
"caighdeánacha de chuid Finder, mar a thuairiscítear in "
":doc:`macosfileprovider`."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:234
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr "Comhroinnt"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:236
msgid ""
"The desktop client integrates sharing actions into Finder on macOS and "
"Explorer on Windows. On Linux, install the integration package for your file"
" manager, such as ``nautilus-nextcloud`` or ``dolphin-nextcloud``."
msgstr ""
"Comhtháthaíonn an cliant deisce gníomhartha comhroinnte le Finder ar macOS "
"agus le Explorer ar Windows. Ar Linux, suiteáil an pacáiste comhtháthaithe "
"do do bhainisteoir comhad, mar shampla ``nautilus-nextcloud`` nó ``dolphin-"
"nextcloud``."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:239
msgid ""
"In your file manager, right-click a file and select **Nextcloud** > **Share "
"options** to open the share dialog."
msgstr ""
"I do bhainisteoir comhad, cliceáil ar dheis ar chomhad agus roghnaigh "
"**Nextcloud** > **Roghanna comhroinnte** chun an dialóg comhroinnte a "
"oscailt."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:241
msgid ""
"Use **Search for recipients** to share the file with people or groups. "
"Existing shares and share links appear below the search field. Use the copy "
"button to copy an internal link or share link. Use the three-dot menu to "
"edit a share, or the **X** button to remove it."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid **Cuardaigh faighteoirí** chun an comhad a roinnt le daoine nó le "
"grúpaí. Tá comhroinntí reatha agus naisc chomhroinnte le feiceáil faoin "
"réimse cuardaigh. Úsáid an cnaipe cóipeála chun nasc inmheánach nó nasc "
"comhroinnte a chóipeáil. Úsáid an roghchlár leis na trí phonc chun "
"comhroinnt a chur in eagar, nó an cnaipe **X** chun í a bhaint."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:245
msgid ""
"Sharing overview with recipient search, existing shares, and link controls"
msgstr ""
"Forbhreathnú ar chomhroinnt, le cuardach faighteoirí, comhroinnte atá ann "
"cheana, agus rialuithe naisc"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:250
msgid ""
"When you edit a share, choose the recipient's permission from the dropdown "
"menu. You can also add a note for the recipients. Changes are applied "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a dhéanann tú comhroinnt a chur in eagar, roghnaigh cead an "
"fhaighteora ón roghchlár anuas. Is féidir leat nóta a chur leis freisin do "
"na faighteoirí. Cuirtear na hathruithe i bhfeidhm láithreach."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:253
msgid "Share details with recipients, permissions, and a note to recipients"
msgstr ""
"Comhroinn sonraí leis na faighteoirí, ceadanna, agus nóta do na faighteoirí"

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:258
msgid ""
"Open **Sharing settings** with the gear button to set an expiration date or "
"protect the share with a password. Changes are applied immediately."
msgstr ""
"Oscail **Socruithe comhroinnte** tríd an gcnaipe fearas chun dáta éaga a "
"shocrú nó chun an comhroinnt a chosaint le pasfhocal. Cuirtear athruithe i "
"bhfeidhm láithreach."

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:261
msgid "Advanced sharing settings for expiration date and password protection"
msgstr ""
"Socruithe roinnte ardleibhéil le haghaidh dáta éaga agus cosaint le "
"pasfhocal"
